Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-venv, python3-pip
Maintainer: GooseThings <noreply@github.com>
Description: Tailgater dish control panel
 Desktop app for controlling a repurposed Dish Network Tailgater antenna
 over USB serial - sky scanning, real-time satellite tracking with a live
 map, and Ku-band pointing calibration, all in one native window.
